      "source_id": "412291b5-bc08-4a10-9080-ea2dd3602b3e",
      "text": "I'll start with just a pinch of chili flakes and add more later if needed. It's better to be safe than sorry, right? I'll also make sure to keep the black pepper on the side in case someone wants more heat. What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s1",
      "source_id": "90ea7864-2b85-4f89-a1c8-e8e461640e87",
      "text": "That sounds like a very sensible approach—being safe is always the best way to go when cooking! 👍\n\nJust to confirm, when you say \"more heat,\" do you mean adding more chili flakes later, or are you referring to just adding the whole mix at the very end? If you decide to keep a small amount of that chili pepper separate, we can definitely keep the initial stir-fry base \"mild\" as you planned! Let me know what you decide!"
    },
