      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s2",
      "source_id": "e6970322-f373-49cf-a286-04e2744263a5",
      "text": "I like both ideas—starting with a little heat and adjusting as we go. Let's go with the plan and see how it turns out. If it's too mild, we can always add more later. Either way, it's flexible."
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s3",
      "source_id": "862d8fa4-76d7-47c4-b85b-fa44efd9a1dd",
      "text": "That sounds like a smart way to keep the control! Starting with a \"mild\" base and adding a little extra heat later if needed is always the safest bet.\n\nJust let me know how the \"Spicy Garlic Chicken Stir-fry\" turns out—I'm curious to know how it turns out! 😋"
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "external",
      "slot": "s4",
      "source_id": "26e3e916-a1a9-436c-9f0d-0b3a8fd0edc1",
      "text": "I'll keep you both posted on how it goes. It's always nice to have a plan, but I'm also ready to adjust if something unexpected comes up. Either way, it's all part of the fun."
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s5",
      "source_id": "43236afc-6338-4d70-8174-ad9066aed5db",
      "text": "That sounds like a great mindset to have! Being flexible and ready to adjust as things develop is key to a good experiment, whether it's cooking or just life in general. Keep me updated on how the \"Spicy Garlic Chicken Stir-fry\" turns out when you're ready! 😊"
    }
  ]
